#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE2307-A expect=skipped domain=FW
#note "FLIPPED violation -> skipped by the R-5.25 split (top-level-or board wave 2, group J, plan §4). FWENDY is not present as a column; the pre-split bare empty(--ENDY) leaf was TRUE on every row (absent = all-missing, EC-43) and flooded. This half now carries Requirements.Variables.All [--ENDY]: an auditable SKIP naming the column. The parent FDA-SE2307 (the --DY half) still EXECUTES on this dataset - FWDY is present and populated, so the split strictly widened coverage. If this EXECUTES, the gate has been removed - escalate, do not rewrite."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset FW class=FINDINGS label="Food and Water Consumption"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col FWSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col FWTESTCD type=Char label="Food/Water Consumption Short Name"
col FWDY     type=Num  label="Study Day of Start of Observation"
---
S1 | FW | 001 | 1 | FCONSUM | 1
S1 | FW | 001 | 2 | FCONSUM | 8
